flowchart BT
    draft[Draft] --> review{Review}
    review -->|changes requested| revise[Revise]
    revise --> review
    review -->|approved| merge[Merge]
    merge --> release[Release notes]
    merge --> deploy[Deploy]
    deploy --> verify{Verify}
    verify -->|pass| close[Close ticket]
    verify -->|fail| revert[Revert]
    revert --> revise
